/// <p>Connects or reconnects a <a href="https://docs.aws.amazon.com/kms/latest/developerguide/key-store-overview.html">custom key store</a> to its backing key store. For an CloudHSM key store, <code>ConnectCustomKeyStore</code> connects the key store to its associated CloudHSM cluster. For an external key store, <code>ConnectCustomKeyStore</code> connects the key store to the external key store proxy that communicates with your external key manager.</p>
